# Framework's download cache — npm bundles and DuckDB extension wasm it fetches
# at build time. Leading ** because it lives at src/.observablehq/cache, and a
# pattern containing a slash is anchored to this file's directory: plain
# ".observablehq/cache/" would only ever match viz/.observablehq/cache.
**/.observablehq/
